    "model_answer": "The documents provided suggest that expression of APOE4 in iPSC-derived neurons increases tau phosphorylation and delays GABA neuron degeneration, but they do not explicitly mention AlphaBeta production being increased by APOE4 expression in these neurons. However, it is known that APOE4 expression leads to higher levels of amylo",
    "selected_doc_ids": "[\"4709641\", \"22185730\", \"22116439\"]",
