    "model_answer": "The evidence is insufficient. The provided documents do not contain information about the frequency of human T-cell lymphotropic virus type 1 infection in individuals of African origin. They discuss other topics, such as SIVagm infection in African green monkeys, type 2 diabetes mellitus in populations of African descent, and the prevalence of frequent headache in a population sample. None of these documents mention human T-cell",
    "selected_doc_ids": "[\"22705234\", \"12662435\", \"24510595\"]",
